 FEATURES\r\nEasy & Fun Matching Game Mechanics\r\n- Tap or slide matching majong tiles to remove them from the puzzle\r\n\r\nShuffle Tiles/Hints/Undos\r\n- Unlimited hints & undos. The game is intended to be fun, easy & relaxing.\r\n- Shuffle the puzzle board & match mahjong tiles if there are no moves on the puzzle\r\n- Too easy? Remove highlighting tiles & hints\r\n \r\nTraditional/Card Tiles \r\n- Select between traditional Mahjong tiles or card Mahjong Tiles if you prefer more of a Solitaire feel\r\n\r\nDaily Challenge Game Puzzles\r\n- Earn points & unlock new game boards to play\r\n- Fun, free & easy puzzle boards added each day. Try and complete the daily puzzle for the entire month to earn trophies\r\n \r\nStats Tracking\r\n- Track your game progress and understand your style of play\r\n- Earn Crowns & Trophies when you complete each game puzzle of Mahjong Free Solitaire\r\n- Game stats are not shown while you work on the Mahjong Puzzle. This way, you focus on relaxing and having fun with your classic Mahjong game\r\n\r\nFun In-Game Animations\r\n- Mahjong Solitaire: Card Game has fun game animations after completing each puzzle\r\n- Fun winning animations will have Majong tiles dancing with you\r\n\r\nWhy Play Mahjong Solitaire\r\n- Play Free Mahjong Games: Classic Card Game offline. Perfect for seniors \r\n- Play at your own pace. When you want a quick break, have fun and play Majong Solitaire: Card Game. Pause any game puzzle and finish it when you have time\r\n- Train Your Brain. Complete fun puzzles to keep your mind sharp. The puzzle is not hard; you have unlimited hints/shuffles if you can\u2019t find tiles to match in the puzzle\r\n\r\nWith its blend of relaxation & brain training, Mahjong Solitaire's classic game offers a holistic gaming experience for all players, including seniors. Feel the stress melt away as you immerse yourself in the art of tile-matching meditation. Regardless of how you write it, Majhang, Majong, Mijong, or \u9ebb\u5c06, it\